{"text":"Land's wine is high, but resolved, a kettle-sob fisted tight over water. Light switches and seizures off of her gold hoops and weaponry. The glint slips into the mirrors, eaten out by her own mastery. James takes a photo of April covering herself from her own squat in the mirror. In spinning her client to the waiting glass, Yolanda makes the black girl see a blackety-black girl gritting white, sitting proud, an eclipse pulled tall. You can count each swivel chair bolted down like a plumb line. Count on your fingers, each of us, the garden of even better things coming. Bus bulging like wet meat, hair spinning forth like Scart's dark cauliflower. We, Begetto Street Furies, turned riot-evolved.","words":[{"text":"Land's","start":0.0,"end":0.84},{"text":"wine","start":0.84,"end":1.14},{"text":"is","start":1.14,"end":1.36},{"text":"high","start":1.36,"end":1.82,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":1.88,"end":2.26},{"text":"resolved","start":2.26,"end":2.94,"punct":","},{"text":"a","start":3.54,"end":3.54},{"text":"kettle-sob","start":3.54,"end":4.28},{"text":"fisted","start":4.28,"end":4.64},{"text":"tight","start":4.64,"end":5.08},{"text":"over","start":5.08,"end":5.82},{"text":"water","start":5.82,"end":6.28,"punct":"."},{"text":"Light","start":6.94,"end":7.26},{"text":"switches","start":7.26,"end":7.64},{"text":"and","start":7.64,"end":8.1},{"text":"seizures","start":8.1,"end":8.58},{"text":"off","start":8.58,"end":9.02},{"text":"of","start":9.02,"end":9.2},{"text":"her","start":9.2,"end":9.34},{"text":"gold","start":9.34,"end":9.66},{"text":"hoops","start":9.66,"end":10.1},{"text":"and","start":10.1,"end":10.36},{"text":"weaponry","start":10.36,"end":10.8,"punct":"."},{"text":"The","start":11.42,"end":11.74},{"text":"glint","start":11.74,"end":12.04},{"text":"slips","start":12.04,"end":12.4},{"text":"into","start":12.4,"end":12.78},{"text":"the","start":12.78,"end":13.04},{"text":"mirrors","start":13.04,"end":13.4,"punct":","},{"text":"eaten","start":13.56,"en